    "sections": {
        "description": "The Startup Blocks Theme is a versatile and modern solution designed for startup founders, entrepreneurs, and businesses looking to build a strong digital presence with a creative and professional edge. Ideal for startups, agencies, and consulting firms, this theme helps showcase startup ideas, funding opportunities, advisory services, legal support, accounting solutions, and growth strategies in a structured and engaging way. Whether you are running a tech startup, a startup agency, or a business consulting service, the theme offers a sleek layout with intuitive navigation and customizable sections for branding, team showcases, testimonials, and success stories. Its responsive and SEO-friendly design ensures your startup stands out across all devices, while built-in marketing tools and call-to-action elements help attract investors and clients. Designed for both early-stage ventures and scaling businesses, it provides a creative platform to present business plans, connect with partners, and establish credibility. With WPForms integration for lead generation and inquiries, the Startup Blocks Theme delivers a flexible, modern, and powerful foundation for any startup, agency, or consulting business aiming to grow and succeed online."
    },
